{
    "title": "France-Visas Short-Stay Tourist Visa Application",
    "content": "This plan completes the France-Visas online application for a short-stay tourist visa through a sequential approach. Due to ephemeral browser sessions, the entire web flow (wizard → account → forms → document generation) must execute in a single browser agent call. Therefore, we first research requirements, then collect all sensitive user data upfront, and finally execute the complete application flow in one continuous session.\n\n**Phase 1: Research** (Task 0-1)\n- Research current France-Visas requirements, form fields, and document checklists\n- Synthesize findings to identify all sensitive data fields required (passport details, travel itinerary, accommodation, financial info, etc.)\n\n**Phase 2: Data Collection** (Task 2)\n- Send structured request to user listing all required sensitive data with clear instructions\n- Pause execution until user provides necessary information\n\n**Phase 3: Execution** (Task 3)\n- Spawn browser agent to complete the entire flow in one session: navigate visa wizard, create account/login, fill all form fields using provided data, generate and download application form, receipt, and checklist",
    "tasks": [
        {
            "goal": "Research France-Visas short-stay tourist visa requirements: required form fields, document checklist, and sensitive data categories needed for the application wizard and form",
            "tool_name": "web_search",
            "depends_on": []
        },
        {
            "goal": "Synthesize research into structured data requirements: categorize all sensitive personal data fields (passport info, travel details, accommodation, financials) and non-sensitive fields, prepare data collection strategy",
            "tool_name": "reasoning",
            "depends_on": [0]
        },
        {
            "goal": "Send message to user requesting all sensitive data required for the visa application (full name, DOB, passport details, travel dates, accommodation address, financial means, etc.) with structured format for easy input",
            "tool_name": "send_message_to_user_execute_phase",
            "depends_on": [1]
        },
        {
            "goal": "Complete full France-Visas application flow in one session: navigate to france-visas.gouv.fr, run visa wizard for short-stay tourist visa, create account or login, fill all application form fields with user-provided sensitive data, generate and download/print the completed application form, receipt, and document checklist",
            "tool_name": "spawn_browser_agent",
            "depends_on": [2]
        }
    ],
    "dependencies_graph": [
        {"task_idx": "0", "depends_on": []},
        {"task_idx": "1", "depends_on": ["0"]},
        {"task_idx": "2", "depends_on": ["1"]},
        {"task_idx": "3", "depends_on": ["2"]}
    ],
    "join": "all"
}
